,"line":68},{"w":"Straight","s":246.78,"e":247.7,"line":69},{"w":"from","s":247.7,"e":248.16,"line":69},{"w":"heaven...","s":248.16,"e":249.19,"line":69},{"w":"...you","s":249.19,"e":249.92,"line":70},{"w":"got","s":249.92,"e":250.29,"line":70},{"w":"any","s":250.29,"e":250.65,"line":70},{"w":"butter?","s":250.65,"e":251.5,"line":70}],"lines":[{"s":1.2,"e":3.4,"text":"Forget the sausage..."},{"s":3.4,"e":5.29,"text":"I FUCKIN' LOST IT."},{"s":5.29,"e":8.23,"text":"They told me twenty-seven..."},{"s":8.23,"e":10.64,"text":"Straight from heaven..."},{"s":10.64,"e":13.79,"text":"And I'm here for the leavened."},{"s":13.79,"e":14.94,"text":"I'm hungry."},{"s":14.94,"e":16.41,"text":"And I can EAT."},{"s":16.41,"e":20.4,"text":"Forget the sausage, I fuckin' lost it,"},{"s":20.4,"e":25.64,"text":"Saw that sacred sugar, had to know what it costed."},{"s":25.64,"e":30.26,"text":"Twenty-seven blessings in a basket of bread,"},{"s":30.26,"e":35.82,"text":"Got a choir full of angels putting crumbs on my head!"},{"s":35.82,"e":41.27,"text":"I'm a hungry little heathen with a heavenly craving,"},{"s":41.27,"e":45.89,"text":"Butter on the Bible, got the bakery shaking!"},{"s":45.89,"e":51.03,"text":"Flour flying, fire rising, frosting on the floor,"},{"s":51.03,"e":57.32,"text":"Heard the Lord say, “Son, what you banging on the door for?”"},{"s":57.32,"e":58.69,"text":"I said—BREAD!"},{"s":58.69,"e":61.31,"text":"Not a biscuit, not a bun!"},{"s":61.31,"e":67.71,"text":"I need a sugar-coated sunrise dripping straight from the sun!"},{"s":67.71,"e":74.32,"text":"I want the golden-glowing goodness, give me seven times eleven,"},{"s":74.32,"e":77.67,"text":"They said, “Baby, twenty-seven!”"},{"s":77.67,"e":80.93,"text":"I said, “STRAIGHT FROM HEAVEN!”"},{"s":80.93,"e":84.18,"text":"Ohhhh, let the dough rise high,"},{"s":84.18,"e":87.96,"text":"Sweet ambrosia falling from the sky!"},{"s":87.96,"e":91.1,"text":"I've been waiting all my life,"},{"s":91.1,"e":94.35,"text":"For a little taste of paradise!"},{"s":94.35,"e":98.03,"text":"TWENTY-SEVEN! STRAIGHT FROM HEAVEN!"},{"s":98.03,"e":101.91,"text":"GIVE ME THAT AMBROSIA LEAVENED BREAD!"},{"s":101.91,"e":104.53,"text":"I'M HUNGRY AND I CAN EAT!"},{"s":104.53,"e":109.15,"text":"GOT THAT HOLY SUGAR RUNNING THROUGH MY HEAD!"},{"s":109.15,"e":112.82,"text":"Twenty-seven! Straight from heaven!"},{"s":112.82,"e":116.17,"text":"Bake it up at seven past eleven!"},{"s":116.17,"e":119.01,"text":"HALLELUJAH! PASS THE PLATE!"},{"s":119.01,"e":122.89,"text":"I CAME FOR BREAD, I AIN'T GONNA WAIT!"},{"s":122.89,"e":125.41,"text":"Lea-lea-leavened! (HEY!)"},{"s":125.41,"e":128.76,"text":"Straight-straight-heaven! (HEY!)"},{"s":128.76,"e":130.97,"text":"Sugar-sugar ambrosia!"},{"s":130.97,"e":132.75,"text":"GIMME THAT BREAD!"},{"s":132.75,"e":134.53,"text":"GIMME THAT BREAD!"},{"s":134.53,"e":135.37,"text":"Wait—"},{"s":135.37,"e":139.78,"text":"Who put the cinnamon inside the cathedral?"},{"s":139.78,"e":143.76,"text":"Why's the archangel acting so illegal?"},{"s":143.76,"e":148.48,"text":"Why's the preacher got a powdered-sugar halo?"},{"s":148.48,"e":154.99,"text":"Why's the whole congregation screaming, “WHERE'D THE CAKE GO?”"},{"s":154.99,"e":159.18,"text":"I ain't asking for a kingdom or a crown,"},{"s":159.18,"e":164.74,"text":"Just a sticky little miracle to wash my worries down!"},{"s":164.74,"e":169.47,"text":"Got a loaf in my left and a roll in my right,"},{"s":169.47,"e":174.4,"text":"I'm a carbohydrate prophet on a Saturday night!"},{"s":174.4,"e":178.7,"text":"Holy moly, macaroni, this is not baloney,"},{"s":178.7,"e":184.68,"text":"All these angels acting like they really, really know me!"},{"s":184.68,"e":190.76,"text":"I said, “Forget the sausage, bring the sacred confection!”"},{"s":190.76,"e":195.48,"text":"Got twenty-seven slices of divine perfection!"},{"s":195.48,"e":198.21,"text":"If heaven has a kitchen..."},{"s":198.21,"e":201.78,"text":"And the stars are made of flour..."},{"s":201.78,"e":204.82,"text":"Let me sit beside the oven..."},{"s":204.82,"e":207.65,"text":"For just one golden hour..."},{"s":207.65,"e":208.8,"text":"I'm hungry."},{"s":208.8,"e":210.27,"text":"And I can eat."},{"s":210.27,"e":211.95,"text":"THEN EEEEEAAAAT!"},{"s":211.95,"e":215.62,"text":"TWENTY-SEVEN! STRAIGHT FROM HEAVEN!"},{"s":215.62,"e":219.5,"text":"GIVE ME THAT AMBROSIA LEAVENED BREAD!"},{"s":219.5,"e":222.13,"text":"I'M HUNGRY AND I CAN EAT!"},{"s":222.13,"e":226.74,"text":"GOT THAT HOLY SUGAR RUNNING THROUGH MY HEAD!"},{"s":226.74,"e":230.41,"text":"Twenty-seven! Straight from heaven!"},{"s":230.41,"e":234.51,"text":"LET THAT DOUGH RISE HIGHER THAN ELEVEN!"},{"s":234.51,"e":237.34,"text":"HALLELUJAH! PASS THE PLATE!"},{"s":237.34,"e":240.8,"text":"THE WHOLE DAMN UNIVERSE IS BAKED!"},{"s":240.8,"e":243,"text":"Forget the sausage..."},{"s":243,"e":245.21,"text":"I finally found it..."},{"s":245.21,"e":246.78,"text":"Twenty-seven..."},{"s":246.78,"e":249.19,"text":"Straight from heaven..."},{"s":249.19,"e":251.5,"text":"...you got any butter?"}],"duration":252,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}